  "notes": "Venango Republican committee seats were last on the ballot in the April 23, 2024 primary as one 'REP Committee Man' and one 'REP Committee Woman' per precinct (44 precincts); the May 19, 2026 primary report has Democratic committee contests but no Republican ones. A seat is 'filled' when a printed ballot candidate received votes, 'empty' when no candidate filed and zero write-in votes were cast, and 'unknown' when write-in votes were cast; this includes seats where the report names a write-in recipient, because it does not show whether that person qualified or accepted. Appointments or vacancies since 2024 are not reflected."
